ss=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Mitchell County has 75 years on record since 1951, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids September to October and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them. In 2025 Jan-Feb ran 21% of normal while June to July hit 175%. So far in 2026, May to June sits at 60% of normal on the middle. Grid 27748 had its driest year in 1989 at 49%.</p>"}
